  "description": "<p data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"376\">Jump terug in klassiek Mario-plezier met <em data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"232\">Super Mario World / Super Mario Advance 2</em> op de <strong data-start=\"239\" data-end=\"268\">Nintendo Game Boy Advance</strong>! Deze geliefde platformklassieker brengt de fantastische wereld van Dinosaur Land tot leven in je handheld.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"381\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"407\">📦 Productinformatie</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"610\">\r\n<li data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"457\">\r\n<p data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"457\"><strong data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"423\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo Game Boy Advance (GBA)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"516\">\r\n<p data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"516\"><strong data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"470\">Titel:</strong> <em data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"514\">Super Mario World / Super Mario Advance 2</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"552\">\r\n<p data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"552\"><strong data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"529\">Genre:</strong> Platform / Adventure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"585\">\r\n<p data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"585\"><strong data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"570\">Speelmodus:</strong> Singleplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"610\">\r\n<p data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"610\"><strong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"601\">Leeftijd:</strong> PEGI 3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"615\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"628\">✅ Staat</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<li data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"652\">\r\n<p data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"652\">Originele cartridge</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"677\">\r\n<p data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"677\"><strong data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"675\">Origineel doosje</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"706\">\r\n<p data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"706\"><strong data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"704\">Boekje / handleiding</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"737\">\r\n<p data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"737\">Getest en volledig werkend</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<p data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"808\">Nette staat (normale gebruikssporen passend bij leeftijd mogelijk)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"813\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"839\">🍄 Waarom deze game?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"1030\">\r\n<li data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n<p data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"893\">Klassieke Mario-game in vereeuwigde handheld-vorm</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"937\">\r\n<p data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"937\">Iconische levels, vijanden en power-ups</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"983\">\r\n<p data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"983\">Gewaardeerd door kinderen én verzamelaars</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1030\">\r\n<p data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1030\">Compleet exemplaar verhoogt verzamelwaarde</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1035\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1052\">🛡 Garantie</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1159\">Bij Used Products ontvang je standaard garantie op je aankoop.<br data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1118\">Zorgeloos en vertrouwd tweedehands kopen.</p>",
